---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout
  eyebrow="教训 · 代码 600132"
  title="重庆啤酒与关灯吃面"
>
  <div class="root">
    <div class="leftCol">
      <div class="postCard">
        <div class="postHeader">
          <span class="postTitle">重庆啤酒(600132) 股吧</span>
          <span class="postActions">关注 回复 分享</span>
        </div>
        <div class="postMeta">
          <p class="postHeading">一边吃，一边哭！！！</p>
          <p class="postAuthor">
            <span class="authorBadge">楼主</span>
            <b class="authorName">renwoxing11</b>
            <span class="authorDot">·</span>2011-12-15 18:25
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="postBody">
          <p class="postText">
            今天回到家，煮了点面吃，一边吃面一边哭，<br/>泪水滴落在碗里，没有开灯。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="postFooter">
          <p class="postFooterText">回复 · 举报 · 分享 · 收藏&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="postClicks">阅读 133.7万</span></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="caption">
        一句"没有开灯"，衍生出 <b>"关灯吃面"</b>，成为股市暴跌的通用语。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div class="rightCol">
      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDot"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearRed">1998 · 押注疫苗</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">主业是<b>啤酒</b>，公司却斥资收购佳辰生物 52% 股权，<br/>引入三军医大"治疗性乙肝疫苗"——一个世纪前的豪赌。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDot"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearRed">2003–2005 · 临床开讲</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">2003 获批 Ⅰ 期、2005 获批 Ⅱ 期临床，<br/>"疫苗故事"正式开讲，股价随之起飞。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDot"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearRed">2007 · 内部见败象</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">Ⅱ期 A 阶段 48 周观察：受试者病毒 DNA 不降、免疫水平低位<br/>—— 疫苗似无效，公司却<b>秘而不宣</b>，死扛。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDot"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearRed">2010–2011.11 · 反向爆炒</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">公司反对外通报<b>"疗效确切"</b>，股价被推向新高；<br/>2011.11 冲高 <b>83.12 元</b>，13 年涨 37 倍，市值一度破 400 亿。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDotGreen"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearGreen">2011.12 · 揭盲崩盘</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">12.8 数据公布：应答率 安慰剂 28.2% / 疫苗组 30.0% / 29.1%<br/>—— 与安慰剂几乎无异。复牌 <b>9 连跌停</b>，200 多亿蒸发，跌回 20 元一线。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="timelineItem">
        <span class="timelineDotGreen"></span>
        <p class="timelineYearGreen">2011.12.15 · 神帖</p>
        <p class="timelineDesc">第 6 个跌停，股吧出现"关灯吃面"神帖，正是左边这一张。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  /* ---- page-specific: 15a1-chongqing-beer ---- */
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Left: post card column */
  .leftCol {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-right: 2rem;
  }

  /* Post card */
  .postCard {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 470px;
    background: #ffffff;
    border: 1px solid #c8d4e0;
    font-family: 'Microsoft YaHei', 'SimSun', sans-serif;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
  }

  .postHeader {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2a5ca8 0%, #1f4b8a 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .postTitle {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .postActions {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #cfe0f5;
  }

  .postMeta {
    padding: 0.9rem 0.9rem 0.6rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e3eaf2;
  }

  .postHeading {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .postAuthor {
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #888;
  }

  .authorBadge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #e8a33d;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem;
    margin-right: 0.4rem;
  }

  .authorName {
    color: #2a5ca8;
  }

  .authorDot {
    margin: 0 0.3rem;
  }

  .postBody {
    padding: 0.9rem;
  }

  .postText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    color: #222;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .postFooter {
    padding: 0.5rem 0.9rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #e3eaf2;
    background: #f4f7fb;
  }

  .postFooterText {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: #2a5ca8;
  }

  .postClicks {
    color: #999;
  }

  /* Caption below card */
  .caption {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 470px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Divider */
  .divider {
    width: 2px;
    align-self: stretch;
    background: #ccc;
  }

  /* Right: timeline */
  .rightCol {
    flex: 1.15;
    min-width: 0;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.8rem;
  }

  /* Timeline item */
  .timelineItem {
    position: relative;
  }

  /* Timeline dot */
  .timelineDot {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1.6rem - 7px);
    top: 0.34rem;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #c0392b;
  }

  .timelineDotGreen {
    position: absolute;
    left: calc(-1.6rem - 7px);
    top: 0.34rem;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #1e7d32;
  }

  .timelineYearRed {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #c0392b;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .timelineYearGreen {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1e7d32;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
  }

  .timelineDesc {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0 0;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>